    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Forge Ahead Into the Steam-Powered Skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the skies of <strong>Durdoon</strong>, where ancient Dwaren ingenuity collides with danger at every altitude. In this <strong>co-op airship rogue-lite management adventure</strong>, you and your crew must brave a fractured world from above, navigating a high-stakes cycle of delivery, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/9091c8963ea61885c33ea12e6ae08897.poster.avif?t=1744521236\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/9091c8963ea61885c33ea12e6ae08897.webm?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/9091c8963ea61885c33ea12e6ae08897.mp4?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Upgrade Your Ship. Shape Your Fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission starts from scratch. Use Dwaren engineering to upgrade components of an airship powered by a detailed steam-pressure system. Your choices matter\u2014from engine power output to a variety of buildable emplacements. Success depends on how well your crew works together... or how well you recover when things go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/e3e88de436af886862cf7aa7ca99a729.poster.avif?t=1744521236\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/e3e88de436af886862cf7aa7ca99a729.webm?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/e3e88de436af886862cf7aa7ca99a729.mp4?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded Choose Your Role. Live the Journey.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crew member plays a vital, unique part in keeping the ship afloat\u2014and alive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain</strong> \u2013 Pilots the ship, issue commands, and make the tough calls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engineer</strong> \u2013 Master the boiler, balance steam flow, and build vital systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waywriter</strong> \u2013 Navigate the unknown, mark points of interest, and unlock upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunner</strong> \u2013 Maintain and man weapons using advanced targeting devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miner</strong> \u2013 Manage cargo and descend to the surface to harvest resources on missions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No role is passive. Every job has depth, every decision has weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/45c09a596e1a89a73e7118f777640d4a.poster.avif?t=1744521236\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/45c09a596e1a89a73e7118f777640d4a.webm?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/45c09a596e1a89a73e7118f777640d4a.mp4?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf04 Dynamic Missions in a Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs from scattered Dwaren ports\u2014simple deliveries, hazardous supply runs, artifact retrievals, and more. But every route is a gauntlet through <strong>Goblurk pirates</strong>, <strong>raiders</strong>, <strong>dragon-like beasts</strong>, and deadly weather. Discover ancient ruins, hideouts, and secrets hidden in the misty canyons of the Durdoon Ranges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/94202ba11cc57d93c961e988d4fb10c3.poster.avif?t=1744521236\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/94202ba11cc57d93c961e988d4fb10c3.webm?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/94202ba11cc57d93c961e988d4fb10c3.mp4?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Return or Be Forgotten</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your run and return your company's ship to port to <strong>claim your rewards</strong>\u2014currency to unlock cosmetics, tools, and tech. But fail to return? If you lose your ship, you lose your loot, and your progress, remember each Airship is company property. Every run is a gamble. Every return is a victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/31506ddee7e55214e2161672a409f9f4.poster.avif?t=1744521236\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/31506ddee7e55214e2161672a409f9f4.webm?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/31506ddee7e55214e2161672a409f9f4.mp4?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Progression That Honors Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your chosen class through repeated missions to unlock unique perks and abilities. Enhance your preferred role, become a legend in your field, or switch it up each run for a fresh challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/ff45a8b3c80da7b0743208f05b173d1c.poster.avif?t=1744521236\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/ff45a8b3c80da7b0743208f05b173d1c.webm?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/ff45a8b3c80da7b0743208f05b173d1c.mp4?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-lite Co-op gameplay focused on coordination and creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep steam-pressure system for realistic ship management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modular ship upgrades: build it your way, every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique crew classes with distinct responsibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic mission generation with handcrafted lore locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-vs-reward return system with unlockable cosmetics and perks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to conquer the skies\u2014or will the mountains claim your bones?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Forge Ahead Into the Steam-Powered Skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the skies of <strong>Durdoon</strong>, where ancient Dwaren ingenuity collides with danger at every altitude. In this <strong>co-op airship rogue-lite management adventure</strong>, you and your crew must brave a fractured world from above, navigating a high-stakes cycle of delivery, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/9091c8963ea61885c33ea12e6ae08897.poster.avif?t=1744521236\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/9091c8963ea61885c33ea12e6ae08897.webm?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/9091c8963ea61885c33ea12e6ae08897.mp4?t=1744521236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Upgrade Your Ship. Shape Your Fate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission starts from scratch. Use Dwaren engineering to upgrade components of an airship powered by a detailed steam-pressure system. Your choices matter\u2014from engine power output to a variety of buildable emplacements. Success depends on how well your crew works together... or how well you recover when things go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/e3e88de436af886862cf7aa7ca99a729.poster.avif?t=1744521236\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2985860/extras/e3e88de436af886862cf7aa7ca99a729.webm?t